          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_CE60B1AB_3927_4382_B362_016EA94A2C80-_ownedComment.0" body="Represents a single individual, a person with their own identity in the system, distinct from any group they belong to. An Account can join one or more Organizations as a member, and may additionally be granted administrator status on an Organization it belongs to" />
        </packagedElement>
